# lfm2.5:8b at its full 128,000-token context. **Rejected. Do not deploy.**
#
# Kept as a build file because the speed numbers are good enough that somebody
# will propose this model again, and because the reason it fails is not
# visible from any benchmark.
#
# It is the fastest model that has ever fit this hardware. Measured 2026-08-27
# on an RX 6600 (8 GiB), alone on one card:
#
# | | `lfm2.5:8b` | `gemma4-e4b-qat-128k` |
# |---|---|---|
# | Prefill | **2,138 tok/s** | 1,126 tok/s |
# | Generation | **107 tok/s** | 44 tok/s |
# | Layers on GPU | 25 of 25 | 43 of 43 |
# | VRAM at full context | 6.1 GiB | 3.7 GiB |
#
# It also puts every weight on the card and maps nothing to host RAM, unlike
# gemma4's E-series, which keeps 4.8 GiB of e2b's 7.2 in host memory. That
# should make concurrent analyses scale better. None of it matters.
#
# **It fabricates prices, and it fails structured output at four stages.** Two
# AAPL runs, on a day AAPL closed at $313.45:
#
# | | Run 1 | Run 2 |
# |---|---|---|
# | Structured-output failures | 4 | 4 |
# | Figures in the market report near the real close | 0 of 6 | 0 of 3 |
# | What it cited instead | $188-196 | $144-150 |
# | Prompt share | 66% | 65% |
#
# The two runs invented prices from different years — roughly AAPL in 2024, then
# AAPL in 2023. That rules out a stale cache and leaves only recall from
# training. The four failing stages are the Sentiment Analyst, Research Manager,
# Trader and Portfolio Manager, which is the identical signature that
# disqualified `llama3.2:3b` and `phi4-mini`.
#
# **Its model card claims tool calling as a strength, and it declares the
# `tools` capability.** Both are true and neither predicts this. A tool-calling
# benchmark measures whether a model picks the right function from a list. It
# does not measure whether the model carries the returned data into a numeric
# field twenty calls later, which is what this pipeline needs.
#
# It is also not the analyst's model on the separate menu test: 2 runs of 8 at
# its shipped sampling, against `gemma4:e4b-it-qat`'s 4 of 4. At temperature 1
# it reached 4 of 4, but one of those researched 11 of the 15 names, which is
# not a choice, and another named SPX, which was not on the menu.
#
# Sampling is what Liquid AI ships: temperature 0.2, top_k 80,
# repeat_penalty 1.05.
FROM lfm2.5:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 128000
